| `src/yaml-validator.test.ts` | 67 unit tests |
| `src/validate-command.test.ts` | 6 integration tests |
| `README.md` | Updated with new command docs |

**Quality metrics:**
- 75/75 tests passing
- 98.31% code coverage
- 16/16 acceptance criteria verified
- No new dependencies added ✓

**Usage:**
```bash
